  "notes": "Aura is a border light effect that can wrap around any component. It is a great way to add a cool, eye-catching visual effect to your components. Aura is useful for the most important button, card, or div that you want to highlight.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/aura/+page.md",
